        "text_ec9WgU": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Founder and Creative Director Angela Hartwick’s elegant lifestyle collection brings together the work of masters in Indian heritage craft with her years working as a stylist and filmmaker in Paris, Dubai and Mumbai. </p><p>Showcasing the analogue beauty of handspun and handwoven fabrics, hand block prints, natural dyes, fine tailoring, and handcarved precious gems – each handcrafted piece in her collection is a glimpse into the rich history and intricate process that has gone into its creation. </p><p><strong>This collection of images is available royalty-free for Hartwick Atelier press purposes. Please email </strong><a href=\"mailto:contact@HartwickAtelier.com\" title=\"mailto:contact@HartwickAtelier.com\"><strong>contact@HartwickAtelier.com</strong></a><strong> for license and high res files.</strong></p><p></p>",
